  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Nessy The NES Robot is a platformer game for the NES & for PC. Where you play as Nessy, a little NES controller-themed robot, on a quest to stop his home, Pixel Park, from total destruction.\r\n\r\nFight your way through zombified robots, slime creatures, and a multitude of other enemies & bosses, as well as a plethora of levels, secrets & easter eggs to discover, collectible gems to... well... collect, as well as characters & dogs to talk to."
    }
  ],
